      {
       "data": "Out[988]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{[t1(u),t1(v)] nonzero entries} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{[t1(u),t3(v)] nonzero entries} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{[t3(u),t3(v)] nonzero entries} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{control: [t1\\^{}z(u), t1\\^{}w0(v)] nonzero entries (expected nonzero)} & 11348\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
