   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. The w-vacuum and its eigenbra check\nv_w=(w1^3,w1^2,w1,1), u_w = 4th row of V(w)^-1, <0_w| = v_w x u_w x v_w x u_w. Test whether <0_w| is an eigenbra of t1^{Gc(w)}(u) and t3^{Gc(w)}(u): residual (psi.t - lambda psi) and lambda(u) interpolated from 5 values of u (exact) and factorised.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "q4vw[w_] := {w[[1]]^3,w[[1]]^2,w[[1]],1};\nq4uw[w_] := Inverse[q4V[w]][[4]];\nq4vac[w_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[q4vw[w],q4uw[w],q4vw[w],q4uw[w]]];\nq4orig[w_] := {q4vw[w],q4uw[w],q4vw[w],q4uw[w]};\nq4q[w_] := q4uw[w].q4Gc[q4z].q4vw[w];\nq4eig[psi_, tm_] := Module[{rr, lm}, rr = psi.tm; lm = (rr.psi)/(psi.psi); {lm, q4nz[rr - lm psi]}];\nq4pts = {1/3,-2/5,7/4,5/6,-3/7};\nq4eigtab[w_] := Module[{G = q4Gc[w], psi = q4vac[w], d1, d3},\n d1 = q4eig[psi, q4t1[#,G]]& /@ q4pts; d3 = q4eig[psi, q4t3[#,G]]& /@ q4pts;\n {Factor[InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{q4pts, d1[[All,1]]}], q4x]], Max[d1[[All,2]]], Factor[InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{q4pts, d3[[All,1]]}], q4x]], Max[d3[[All,2]]]}];\nq4ev0 = q4eigtab[q4w0];\nGrid[{{\"w\", \"lambda_t1(x)\", \"#nonzero residual entries t1\", \"lambda_t3(x) (no prefactor)\", \"#nonzero residual t3\"}, Prepend[q4ev0, q4w0]}, Frame->All, Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"108\" data-out-n=\"1013\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1013]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.67em;vertical-align:-1.065em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.605em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.565em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.565em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.63em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.065em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.565em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.795em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.07em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">w</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.365em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.07em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;