ht:7.085em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.55em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.085em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.085em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.085em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.17em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.085em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.585em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1166]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{W} & \\text{w} & \\text{u\\_w.v\\_w} & \\text{q=u\\_w Gc(z) v\\_w} & \\text{predicted} & \\text{match}\\\\\\hline\\text{W0} & \\left\\{\\frac{7}{5},\\frac{9}{8},\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{5}{9}\\right\\} & 0 & \\frac{232551}{1558000} & \\frac{232551}{1558000} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{W1} & \\left\\{\\frac{3}{2},\\frac{9}{8},\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{5}{9}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{W2} & \\left\\{\\frac{2}{3},\\frac{9}{8},\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{5}{9}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{W3} & \\left\\{\\frac{7}{5},\\frac{9}{8},\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{4}{7}\\right\\} & 0 & \\frac{539}{3875} & \\frac{539}{3875} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{W4} & \\left\\{\\frac{7}{5},\\frac{9}{8},\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{3}{2}\\right\\} & 0 & \\frac{1276}{5625} & \\frac{1276}{5625} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{W5} & \\left\\{\\frac{3}{2},\\frac{9}{8},\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{4}{7}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{W6} & \\left\\{\\frac{3}{2},\\frac{5}{4},\\frac{2}{3},\\frac{4}{7}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
