  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Eigenbra result (all exact)\nThe cell above shows <0_w| (v_w x u_w x v_w x u_w, with v_w = right eigenvector of Gc(w) for w1, u_w = left eigenvector for w4) IS an exact eigenbra of t1^{Gc(w)}(u) and t3^{Gc(w)}(u) (zero residual at 5 values of u). A scan of all products (A site = right eigenvector C_i or left eigenvector R_i of Gc(w), F site likewise) shows eigenbras exactly for (A=C_i, F=R_j), i != j (12 states). Next cell fits lambda_t1(x) = w1 Q1 + (w2+w3) Q2 + w4 Q4 exactly (Q_i independent of w, solved from four different w and verified on a fifth).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "q4isEig[psi_, tm_] := MatrixRank[{psi, psi.tm}] == 1;\nq4scan = Module[{w = q4w0, G, V, cand, tm, ps},\n G = q4Gc[w]; V = q4V[w]; tm = q4t1[1/3, G];\n cand = Join[Table[{\"R\"<>ToString[i], Inverse[V][[i]]}, {i,4}], Table[{\"C\"<>ToString[i], V[[All,i]]}, {i,4}]];\n Flatten[Table[ps = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a[[2]],f[[2]],a[[2]],f[[2]]]]; If[q4isEig[ps, tm], {a[[1]], f[[1]]}, Nothing], {a,cand},{f,cand}],1]];\nq4Qfit = Module[{ws, lams, Q}, ws = {q4w0, {3/2,9/8,3/7,5/9}, {7/5,2,3/7,5/9}, {7/5,9/8,3,5/9}, {7/5,9/8,3/7,7}};\n lams = q4eigtab[#][[1]]& /@ ws; Q = LinearSolve[ws[[1;;4]], lams[[1;;4]]]; {Factor /@ Q, Simplify[ws[[5]].Q - lams[[5]]]}];\nGrid[{{\"(A,F) product eigenbras of t1^{Gc(w0)} (A=C_i right evec, F=R_j left evec, same on sites 1,3 / 2,4)\", q4scan}, {\"Q1,Q2,Q3,Q4 with lambda = Sum w_i Q_i, and residual on 5th w\", q4Qfit[[1]]}, {\"residual\", q4Qfit[[2]]}, {\"theta\", q4th}}, Frame->All, Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
