  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Localisation machinery (all exact rational arithmetic)\nFactor = {type, s, m, p}: t_type^z(theta_s + m h)^p. Inverses via exact LinearSolve of the transposed matrix (bra action psi t^-1). Analysis of a bra psi: site matricisations 4x64 (exact rank), pair matricisations 16x16 for 12|34, 13|24, 14|23; for rank-1 sites the site vector a is compared with the original o_s via: equal; proportional to o.M; or in span{o, o.M} (reported as o(1 - kappa M)), for M in {G, G^T, G^-1, G^-T}, G = Gc(z). Test of matricisation permutation on known entangled/product states follows.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Exact LU/solves of 256x256 rationals were too slow, so the scan uses 50-digit arithmetic; ranks by SVD with relative tolerance 10^-25 *)\nq4P = 50;\nq4mat[1,u_] := q4mat[1,u] = q4t1[u,q4Gz];\nq4mat[3,u_] := q4mat[3,u] = q4t3[u,q4Gz];\nq4matN[ty_,u_] := q4matN[ty,u] = SetPrecision[Normal[q4mat[ty,u]], q4P];\nq4lu[ty_,u_] := q4lu[ty,u] = Module[{m = q4matN[ty,u], sv},\n  sv = SingularValueList[m]; If[Last[sv] < 10^-25 First[sv], $Failed, Quiet[Check[LinearSolve[Transpose[m]], $Failed]]]];\nq4uof[s_,m_] := q4th[[s]] + m q4h;\nq4app[psi_, {ty_,s_,m_,p_}] := Module[{u = q4uof[s,m], f},\n Which[psi === $Failed, $Failed, p == 0, psi, p > 0, Nest[#.q4matN[ty,u]&, psi, p], True, f = q4lu[ty,u]; If[f === $Failed, $Failed, Nest[f, psi, -p]]]];\nq4word[psi_, facs_List] := Fold[q4app, SetPrecision[psi, q4P], facs];\nq4Ms = {\"G\"->q4Gz, \"G^T\"->Transpose[q4Gz], \"G^-1\"->Inverse[q4Gz], \"G^-T\"->Transpose[Inverse[q4Gz]]};\nq4rk[vs_] := Module[{nv = Select[vs, Norm[#] > 10^-35&], sv}, If[nv === {}, 0, sv = SingularValueList[Normalize /@ nv]; Count[sv, s_ /; s > 10^-25 sv[[1]]]]];\nq4ident[a_, o_] := Module[{res = {}, om, sol},\n If[q4rk[{a,o}] == 1, \"=\",\n  Do[om = o.(M[[2]]); If[q4rk[{a,om}] == 1, AppendTo[res, \"~o.\"<>M[[1]]]], {M, q4Ms}];\n  Do[om = o.(M[[2]]); If[q4rk[{o,om}] == 2 && q4rk[{a,o,om}] == 2, sol = PseudoInverse[Transpose[{o,om}]].a; If[Abs[sol[[1]]] > 10^-25 Abs[sol[[2]]], AppendTo[res, \"o(1-(\"<>ToString[NumberForm[Re[-sol[[2]]/sol[[1]]], 8]]<>\")\"<>M[[1]]<>\")\"]]], {M, q4Ms}];\n  If[res === {}, \"moved?\", StringRiffle[res, \" | \"]]]];\nq4perm[ord_] := Ordering[ord];\nq4siteMat[psi_, s_] := ArrayReshape[Transpose[ArrayReshape[psi,{4,4,4,4}], q4perm[Join[{s}, DeleteCases[{1,2,3,4}, s]]]], {4,64}];\nq4pairMat[psi_, s_, t_] := ArrayReshape[Transpose[ArrayReshape[psi,{4,4,4,4}], q4perm[Join[{s,t}, DeleteCases[{1,2,3,4}, s|t]]]], {16,16}];\nq4firstCol[m_] := First[MaximalBy[Transpose[m], Norm]];\nq4firstRow[m_] := First[MaximalBy[m, Norm]];\nq4pairings = {{1,2,3,4},{1,3,2,4},{1,4,2,3}};\nq4analyse[psi0_, orig0_] := Module[{psi, orig, r1, sites, pr, blk, tag},\n If[psi0 === $Failed, Return[<|\"str\"->\"singular\", \"r1\"->{}, \"pr\"->{}|>]];\n psi = psi0/Norm[psi0]; orig = SetPrecision[orig0, q4P];\n r1 = Table[q4rk[q4siteMat[psi,s]], {s,4}];\n sites = Table[If[r1[[s]] == 1, ToString[s]<>\":\"<>q4ident[q4firstCol[q4siteMat[psi,s]], orig[[s]]], Nothing], {s,4}];\n pr = Table[q4rk[q4pairMat[psi, p[[1]], p[[2]]]], {p, q4pairings}];\n blk = Table[If[pr[[i]] == 1 && r1 =!= {1,1,1,1}, With[{p = q4pairings[[i]], m = q4pairMat[psi, q4pairings[[i,1]], q4pairings[[i,2]]]}, ToString[p[[1]]]<>ToString[p[[2]]]<>\"|\"<>ToString[p[[3]]]<>ToString[p[[4]]]<>\" splits: \"<>ToString[p[[1]]]<>ToString[p[[2]]]<>If[q4rk[{q4firstCol[m], Flatten[KroneckerProduct[orig[[p[[1]]]], orig[[p[[2]]]]]]}] == 1, \"=\", \"mv\"]<>\", \"<>ToString[p[[3]]]<>ToString[p[[4]]]<>If[q4rk[{q4firstRow[m], Flatten[KroneckerProduct[orig[[p[[3]]]], orig[[p[[4]]]]]]}] == 1, \"=\", \"mv\"]], Nothing], {i,3}];\n tag = If[r1 === {1,1,1,1}, \"PRODUCT\", \"ENT r=\"<>ToString[r1]<>\" pairs(12|13|14)=\"<>ToString[pr]];\n <|\"str\"->tag<>\" ; \"<>StringRiffle[sites, \" \"]<>If[blk === {}, \"\", \" ; \"<>StringRiffle[blk, \"; \"]], \"r1\"->r1, \"pr\"->pr|>];\nq4e4[i_] := UnitVector[4,i];\nq4bell = Flatten[Sum[KroneckerProduct[q4e4[i], {1,2,3,4}, q4e4[i], {4,3,2,1}], {i,4}]];\nq4prod = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[{1,2,3,4},{1,0,2,5},{7,1,1,0},{1,1,1,1}]];\nGrid[{{\"bell(1,3) x y2 x y4: expect site ranks {4,1,4,1}, pairs 12|34 rank 4, 13|24 rank 1, 14|23 rank 4\", q4analyse[SetPrecision[q4bell,q4P], q4orig[q4w0]][\"str\"]}, {\"product: expect PRODUCT\", q4analyse[SetPrecision[q4prod,q4P], q4orig[q4w0]][\"str\"]}, {\"w0 vacuum itself\", q4analyse[q4vac[q4w0], q4orig[q4w0]][\"str\"]}}, Frame->All, Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"111\" data-out-n=\"1067\" data-sub-idx=\"22\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"36\" data-sub-end=\"36\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1067]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bell(1,3) x y2 x y4: expect site ranks {4,1,4,1}, pairs 12|34 rank 4, 13|24 rank 1, 14|23 rank 4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">product: expect PRODUCT</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">w0 vacuum itself</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ENT r={4, 1, 4, 1} pairs(12|13|14)={4, 1, 4} ; 2:moved? 4:moved? ; 13|24 splits: 13mv, 24mv</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PRODUCT ; 1:moved? 2:moved? 3:moved? 4:moved?</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PRODUCT ; 1:= 2:= 3:= 4:=</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1067]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{bell(1,3) x y2 x y4: expect site ranks \\{4,1,4,1\\}, pairs 12|34 rank 4, 13|24 rank 1, 14|23 rank 4} & \\text{ENT r=\\{4, 1, 4, 1\\} pairs(12|13|14)=\\{4, 1, 4\\} ; 2:moved? 4:moved? ; 13|24 splits: 13mv, 24mv}\\\\\\hline\\text{product: expect PRODUCT} & \\text{PRODUCT ; 1:moved? 2:moved? 3:moved? 4:moved?}\\\\\\hline\\text{w0 vacuum itself} & \\text{PRODUCT ; 1:= 2:= 3:= 4:=}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
