  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. Compact table (word x W0..W6)\nCodes: P = product state, then per-site: '=' unchanged, 'G','GT','Gi','GiT' = site vector is o.M for M = G, G^T, G^-1, G^-T (G = Gc(z)), 'o(1-(k)M)' = o - k o.M. E{r1r2r3r4}/{p12 p13 p14} = entangled with single-site ranks r_s and pair ranks for 12|34, 13|24, 14|23; sites that still factor are listed with their identification. 'singular' = transfer matrix not invertible. Numerics: 50-digit arithmetic, rank tolerance 1e-25 relative.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "q4tabW = {\"W0\",\"W1\",\"W2\",\"W3\",\"W4\",\"W5\",\"W6\"};\nq4short[s_String] := StringReplace[s, {\"PRODUCT ; \"->\"P \", RegularExpression[\"ENT r=\\\\{(\\\\d), (\\\\d), (\\\\d), (\\\\d)\\\\} pairs\\\\(12\\\\|13\\\\|14\\\\)=\\\\{(\\\\d+), (\\\\d+), (\\\\d+)\\\\} ; \"]->\"E$1$2$3$4/$5,$6,$7 \", \"~o.\"->\"\", \" splits: \"->\":\", \"G^-T\"->\"GiT\", \"G^-1\"->\"Gi\", \"G^T\"->\"GT\"}];\nq4tab = Prepend[Table[Prepend[Table[q4short[q4res[w][l][\"str\"]], {w, q4tabW}], l], {l, Keys[q4res[\"W0\"]]}], Prepend[q4tabW, \"word\"]];\nGrid[q4tab, Frame->All, Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"115\" data-out-n=\"1121\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"17\" data-sub-start=\"3\" data-sub-end=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1121]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div data-wolfram-is-skeleton=\"1\" data-wolfram-atom-count=\"1367\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mv5biy80-7wq69qn\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:181.24em;vertical-align:-90.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:90.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-92.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:92.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:181.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-90.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:90.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-93.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">word</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-91.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t1(th1-3h)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-90.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"heig