      {
       "data": "Out[1121]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{word} & \\text{W0} & \\text{W1} & \\text{W2} & \\text{W3} & \\text{W4} & \\text{W5} & \\text{W6}\\\\\\hline\\text{t1(th1-3h)} & \\text{E4444/4,6,6 } & \\text{E1212/2,1,2 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{E1212/2,1,2 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{E4444/4,6,6 } & \\text{E4444/4,6,6 } & \\text{E1212/2,1,2 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{P 1:= 2:= 3:= 4:=}\\\\\\hline\\text{t1(th1-3h)\\^{}-1} & \\text{E4444/16,16,16 } & \\text{E1313/3,1,3 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{E1313/3,1,3 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{E4444/16,16,16 } & \\text{E4444/16,16,16 } & \\text{E1313/3,1,3 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{P 1:= 2:= 3:= 4:=}\\\\\\hline\\text{t1(th1-2h)} & \\text{E4444/4,6,6 } & \\text{E1212/2,1,2 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{E1212/2,1,2 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{E4444/4,6,6 } & \\text{E4444/4,6,6 } & \\text{E1212/2,1,2 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{P 1:= 2:= 3:= 4:=}\\\\\\hline\\text{t1(th1-2h)\\^{}-1} & \\text{E4444/16,16,16 } & \\text{E1313/3,1,3 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{E1313/3,1,3 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{E4444/16,16,16 } & \\text{E4444/16,16,16 } & \\text{E1313/3,1,3 1:= 3:= ; 13|24:13=, 24mv} & \\text{P 1:= 2:= 3:= 4:=}\\… [latex truncated: 38938 chars total]",
