  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. Case (d): one-parameter families on interior sites\nW1 (w1 = z1): psi = <0_w| t1(theta_2) should be c times (psi with site 2 -> o_2 G). Then psi(1 + a t1(theta_2)) has site 2 = o(1 - kappa G) with kappa = -a c. Check for several a. Also kappa of the single words t1(theta_4+h) (site 4) and t3(theta_2+2h) (site 2, with G^-1) in W1, W2, with rational recognition. W0: ranks of interior single-site words.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "q4kap[w_, facs_, s_, Mname_] := Module[{psi = q4word[q4vac[w], facs], o, a, M, sol},\n psi = psi/Norm[psi]; a = q4firstCol[q4siteMat[psi, s]]; o = SetPrecision[q4orig[w][[s]], q4P]; M = SetPrecision[Mname /. q4Ms, q4P];\n sol = PseudoInverse[Transpose[{o, o.M}]].a; Rationalize[-sol[[2]]/sol[[1]], 10^-25]];\nq4W1 = {3/2,9/8,3/7,5/9}; q4W2 = {2/3,9/8,3/7,5/9};\nq4famTest[w_, a_] := Module[{psi0 = q4vac[w], psi},\n psi = SetPrecision[psi0, q4P] + a q4word[psi0, {{1,2,0,1}}]; q4analyse[psi, q4orig[w]][\"str\"]];\n(* c: psi t1(th2) = c * (psi with site 2 replaced by o2.G) *)\nq4c[w_] := Module[{o = q4orig[w], psi0 = q4vac[w], tgt, t},\n tgt = SetPrecision[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[o[[1]], o[[2]].q4Gz, o[[3]], o[[4]]]], q4P]; t = q4word[psi0, {{1,2,0,1}}];\n {Rationalize[(t.tgt)/(tgt.tgt), 10^-25], q4rk[{t, tgt}]}];\nq4cW1 = q4c[q4W1];\nq4cW2 = q4c[q4W2];\nq4dres = {{\"W1: c and rank{psi t1(th2), psi[site2->o2 G]} (rank 1 = exactly proportional)\", q4cW1},\n {\"W2: same\", q4cW2},\n {\"W1, psi(1 + a t1(th2)) with a = 1/3 (predicted kappa = -a c)\", {q4famTest[q4W1, 1/3], N[-(1/3) q4cW1[[1]]]}},\n {\"W1, a = -2\", {q4famTest[q4W1, -2], N[2 q4cW1[[1]]]}},\n {\"W0: psi(1 + a t1(th2)), a = 1/3\", q4famTest[q4w0, 1/3]},\n {\"W0: psi(1 + a t1(th3)), a = 1/3\", Module[{psi0 = q4vac[q4w0], psi}, psi = SetPrecision[psi0,q4P] + (1/3) q4word[psi0, {{1,3,0,1}}]; q4analyse[psi, q4orig[q4w0]][\"str\"]]},\n {\"W1: kappa of t1(th4+h) on site 4 (M=G)\", q4kap[q4W1, {{1,4,1,1}}, 4, \"G\"]},\n {\"W2: kappa of t1(th4+h) on site 4 (M=G)\", q4kap[q4W2, {{1,4,1,1}}, 4, \"G\"]},\n {\"W1: kappa of t3(th2+2h) on site 2 (M=G^-1)\", q4kap[q4W1, {{3,2,2,1}}, 2, \"G^-1\"]},\n {\"W2: kappa of t3(th2+2h) on site 2 (M=G^-1)\", q4kap[q4W2, {{3,2,2,1}}, 2, \"G^-1\"]}};\nGrid[q4dres, Frame->All, Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"119\" data-out-n=\"1159\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1159]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:12.0804em;vertical-align:-5.7702em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.3102em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.2702em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.2702em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12.0404em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.7702em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.2702em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.4202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">W1: c and rank{psi t1(th2), psi[site2-&gt;o2 G]} (rank 1 = exactly proportional)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.2102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">W2: same</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.0102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">W1, psi(1 + a t1(th2))