  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Summary (precision: sanity checks, eigenbra checks, q values exact rational; the scan uses 50-digit arithmetic with SVD rank tolerance 1e-25, singularity test of transfer matrices in machine precision with threshold 1e-12)\n\n**Eigenbra.** <0_w| = v_w x u_w x v_w x u_w IS an exact eigenbra of t1^{Gc(w)}(u) and t3^{Gc(w)}(u) (zero residual at 5 values of u). Product eigenbras are exactly (A = right evec C_i, F = left evec R_j), i != j. Eigenvalue: lambda_t1(u) = w1 (u-th1+h)(u-th2)(u-th3+h)(u-th4) + (w2+w3) Prod_s(u-th_s) + w4 (u-th1)(u-th2-h)(u-th3)(u-th4-h).\n\n**q = u_w Gc(z) v_w** equals -(u_w)_1 Prod_i(w1-z_i) exactly for W0..W6: nonzero for W0 (232551/1558000), W3 (539/3875), W4 (1276/5625); zero for W1, W2, W5, W6. w4 in {z} (W3, W4) changes nothing: W3, W4 give the same patterns as W0, and W5 the same as W1.\n\n**Pattern.** Generic w (q != 0, W0/W3/W4): t1(th1)^-1 -> site 1 moves by G^-T; t1(th4)^-1 -> site 4 by G^-1; end-growing chains t1(th1)^-1 t1(th2) [t1(th3)^-1 [t1(th4)]] give product states with sites 1,3 -> o.G^-T, sites 2,4 -> o.G (from site 1); mirror chains from site 4 give 4: G^-1, 3: G^T, 2: G^-1, 1: G^T. Interior single-site words entangle (t1(th2): block {1,2} entangled, sites 3,4 unchanged; t1(th3): block {3,4} entangled, 1,2 unchanged; t1(th2)^-1: only site 1 unchanged). Good-reference case (q = 0, W1/W2/W5): t1(th1)^+-1, t1(th3)^+-1 act as scalars on <0_w| (all sites unchanged); t1(th2) moves site 2 by G; t1(th4)^-1 moves site 4 by G^-1; t1(th4+h) acts as o(1-kappa G) on site 4, t3(th2+2h) as o(1-kappa G^-1) on site 2; but the 'wrong' powers (t1(th2)^-1, t1(th4)) do NOT localise (sites 1,3 unchanged, 2,4 entangled with rank 2). W6 = trivial.\n\nSee the table above for every word.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  }
 ],
